      "pattern": "\\b(?:diagnostic|diagnosis|pathologie|comorbidit[ée]s?|ant[ée]c[ée]dents\\s+m[ée]dicaux|[ée]tat\\s+de\\s+sant[ée])\\b",
      "criticality": "medium",
      "hint": "The word alone. It is as often a machine being diagnosed as a person."
    },
    {
      "label": "Disability or long-term condition",
      "pattern": "\\b(?:RQTH|handicap(?:[ée]e?s?)?|invalidit[ée]|taux\\s+d['’]incapacit[ée]|ALD\\b|affection\\s+de\\s+longue\\s+dur[ée]e|MDPH|inaptitude|am[ée]nagement\\s+de\\s+poste|disability|reasonable\\s+accommodation)\\b",
      "criticality": "high"
    },
    {
      "label": "Treatment or prescription",
      "pattern": "\\b(?:traitement\\s+(?:en\\s+cours|m[ée]dicamenteux)|posologie|chimioth[ée]rapie|antid[ée]presseur|anxiolytique|insuline|prescription\\s+for|mg/jour|allergies?\\s*:)\\b",
